{"id":"n5_u12_l3","unit_id":"n5_u12","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Particles at a glance","goal":"Put the particles together: は が を に で へ の も と か.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_particles_review"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Which particle?","body":["If the verb acts on a thing: を. If the action happens in a place: で. If something exists in a place: に. A destination: へ. The topic: は. What exists, is liked or is done well: が."],"examples":[{"ja":"えき で ともだち に あいます","reading":"eki de tomodachi ni aimasu","en":"I meet my friend at the station."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u12_gp01","q_n5u12_gp02","q_n5u12_gp03","q_n5u12_gp04","q_n5u12_gp05","q_n5u12_gp06","q_n5u12_gp07","q_n5u12_gp08"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u12_gp01","q_n5u12_gp02","q_n5u12_gp03","q_n5u12_gp04","q_n5u12_gp06","q_n5u12_gp07"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
